  "arduino": "// Simulated sound intensity, not a live microphone or audio waveform.\n// Default DO is HIGH at/above threshold. Set attrs.activeLow for inverse DO.\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n  pinMode(2, INPUT); pinMode(3, INPUT);\n  pinMode(LED_BUILTIN, OUTPUT);\n}\nvoid loop() {\n  Serial.print(analogRead(A0)); Serial.print(',');\n  Serial.print(analogRead(A1)); Serial.print(',');\n  Serial.print(digitalRead(2)); Serial.print(','); Serial.println(digitalRead(3));\n  digitalWrite(LED_BUILTIN, digitalRead(2) || digitalRead(3));\n  delay(80);\n}\n",
